# --- deployment state ---
# Database dumps written by `bojan backup`. These carry customer data.
#
# Anchored to the repository root. Unanchored, `backups/` matches a directory of
# that name at any depth — including `apps/admin/src/app/api/admin/backups/`,
# the panel's own download route, whose files git was quietly refusing to add.
# The one already committed survived because tracking outranks the rule; the
# next file added beside it would have gone missing with no error at all.
/backups/

